* Constant On-Time Lab -- stateful hysteretic phase shedding abstraction
* ILOAD uses 1 V/A. ACTIVE2 ramps high when ILOAD>IADD and low when
* ILOAD<ISHED; between thresholds the capacitor holds its state.

.MODEL D_SHED_COTLAB D (IS=1n N=1 RS=1m TT=1n CJO=1p)

* PHASE_SHEDDING_2 ILOAD FORCE_ON ACTIVE2 STATE
.SUBCKT PHASE_SHEDDING_2 ILOAD FORCE_ON ACTIVE2 STATE PARAMS:
+ ISHED=2 IADD=3 TRAMP=20u CSTATE=10n VLOGIC=1
VHI VHI 0 {VLOGIC}
GSTATE STATE 0 VALUE={IF(V(FORCE_ON)>VLOGIC/2,
+ IF(V(STATE)<VLOGIC,-CSTATE*VLOGIC/TRAMP,0),
+ IF(V(ILOAD)>IADD,
+ IF(V(STATE)<VLOGIC,-CSTATE*VLOGIC/TRAMP,0),
+ IF(V(ILOAD)<ISHED,
+ IF(V(STATE)>0,CSTATE*VLOGIC/TRAMP,0),0)))}
CSTATEH STATE 0 {CSTATE} IC=0
DCLAMPH STATE VHI D_SHED_COTLAB
DCLAMPL 0 STATE D_SHED_COTLAB
EACTIVE ACTIVE2 0 VALUE={IF(V(STATE)>VLOGIC/2,VLOGIC,0)}
RACTIVE ACTIVE2 0 1G
.ENDS PHASE_SHEDDING_2
